{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Casual Action-Adventure</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IT'S ABOUT TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as 20 year old <strong>William Roger</strong>. It\u2019s 2001 and your University professor has something special to show you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cimera,</strong>\u00a0a time traveling camera. That\u2019s right, you accidentally activate it and get sucked through a time portal and land on a cliched beach, a long time ago, in a land far far away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/7fa84094170d7064f9219730e8a2afc6.poster.avif?t=1768950888\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/7fa84094170d7064f9219730e8a2afc6.webm?t=1768950888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/7fa84094170d7064f9219730e8a2afc6.mp4?t=1768950888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> EXPLORE YOUR ADVENTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure your way through time, discovering your <strong>independence</strong>, uncovering the <strong>secrets</strong> of the <strong>Time Earth Agency</strong> and the <strong>Professors</strong> plans to dominate time and space. Will you find your way back home before you are history?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost, stolen, beaten, eaten and abducted by aliens (well, not that last part), explore your way from the past to the future by adapting to your surroundings, finding the lost <strong>Time Pages</strong> and a mass of other collectables. Why do you have so much sand in your shoe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/3c1c07af139549f7821e8709d42ba084.poster.avif?t=1768950888\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/3c1c07af139549f7821e8709d42ba084.webm?t=1768950888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/3c1c07af139549f7821e8709d42ba084.mp4?t=1768950888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND YOUR YOURSELF!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a victorious arena champion, bumble your way through a mistaken murder investigation, find love, become a friend, save the village. All this because of a little &quot;<strong>accidental&quot;</strong> trip to the past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your skills and fight enemies you never thought you would and of course, battle yourself, again and again and again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only one person that can save the universe! Well, maybe 2.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEWARE THE AGENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escaping from the <strong>Cimera Universal Police</strong>  is only one of your many concerns. Able to track your whereabouts once you activate the Cimera and jump, they stop at nothing to capture you and your precious camera.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME IS OF THE ESSENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up against the clock so to speak. The <strong>countdown</strong> on the <strong>Camera</strong> has started. Can you make the next jump before it's too late? Help the local folk. complete missions and make the infernal camera work again.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/d59fac65ebb08571902bafa1bec841b1.poster.avif?t=1768950888\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/d59fac65ebb08571902bafa1bec841b1.webm?t=1768950888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/extras/d59fac65ebb08571902bafa1bec841b1.mp4?t=1768950888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Featuring:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Styled</strong> graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original</strong> music and sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncluttered</strong>\u00a0User Interface. (because who wants to sift through a spreadsheet of data)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Leveling System </strong>- Toughness. Independence. Muscle. Endurance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hybrid</strong> style cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many references to your favorite movies and games.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, yes, and a cool purple <strong>backpack. </strong><br> <br> <br>Grab your <strong>fake leather backpack</strong>, navigate through time and space, get home, save the universe and accomplish so much more than you thought you could before time runs out in this, the first chapter of Time Jump.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3334640?t=1768950888","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/fd0f6d9ead51452e70b1d525d9a6bda106d1da2b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768950888","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334640/284e26480ddfcd88d507deb8caff8f7462fd964d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17